      "multiselect": false,
      "options": [
       "in RAM",
       "in VRAM"
      ],
      "tooltip": "Where the 256 x 40 routed experts (90% of the model) live. In RAM, each frame copies only the 8 experts per layer it uses and keeps recent ones in a VRAM cache: needs the file's size in system RAM. In VRAM needs the whole file in VRAM (or split over two GPUs)."
     }
    ],
    "model_name": [
     "COMBO",
